codemap 8
path reader-gui
kind flow
author ai
group gui
note The human's surface as one frame. There is no retained widget tree and no model layer: every frame the frame function polls the background work, feeds the frame's keys to whichever field has focus, then opens and closes elements for the whole window - top bar, left panel, the centre tab, the xrefs panel, the output panel, the status bar - and hands the tree to the layout and the renderer. A panel never mutates the app while it draws; a click pushes an Action and apply runs the queue once the tree is built, which is what lets a panel hold the whole App borrowed. Editing is limited to what a reader needs - deleting a step or a path, pinning a selection from the listing, creating an empty path - and everything else is typed into the output panel as a CLI command.

